WEBVTT

00:21:29.032 --> 00:21:30.921
"Beje."

00:21:30.921 --> 00:21:42.785
(Te qeshura)(Duartrokitje)

00:21:42.785 --> 00:21:44.646
Mendoj se ishte nje keshille e mire.

00:21:44.646 --> 00:21:46.714
Do ta ndjek keshillen e saj. Do te pushoj se foluri.

00:21:46.714 --> 00:21:50.704
Faleminderit. Faleminderit shume.

00:21:50.704 --> 00:21:54.455
(Duartrokitje)

00:21:54.455 --> 00:22:02.779
Faleminderit. Faleminderit.(Duartrokitje)